Usage: ledger [--date YYYYMMDD] MASTER TRANSACTIONS OUTDIR
 
Applies a day's transactions to an account master file.
 
  MASTER        account master file, sorted by account
  TRANSACTIONS  deposits, withdrawals and transfers
  OUTDIR        receives accounts.new.dat, statements.txt,
                exceptions.txt, control.txt and events.jsonl
  --date        run date printed on reports (default today)
 
Exit status: 0 clean, 4 exceptions reported, 16 run aborted.
[exit 0]
